    },
    {
      "section": "changestab",
      "text": "English | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\nProvides a sidebar Changes view for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/dsh)\n\nSupports navigating the change history and viewing file diffs side-by-side or stacked depending on available display width."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add changestab\n```\n\nInstall it into the web profile, the one that runs the GUI."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "To test a local checkout instead of the published package, install it directly: `dsh plugin --profile web add /path/to/changestab`\n\nFor a source checkout or local path install, run `pnpm install && npm run build` first so the bundle exists."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm install     # a local (uncommitted) .npmrc may pin the pnpm store repo-locally\nnpm run build    # tsc (host + client) + tsdown bundle\nnpm test         # build + the full suite (pure parser tests + real jj/git I/O when the binaries are on PATH)\nnpm run e2e      # browser journeys against a sandboxed dsh instance\n\n[CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md) · [Releases](https://github.com/americanjeff/changestab/releases)."
    }
